OL,3,AFirst minister demands 'new deal' for
OL,4,AWales before Plaid Cymru conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister and leader of Plaid
OL,7,FCymru has written to the prime minister
OL,8,Frequesting "a new deal for Wales" ahead
OL,9,Fof his first party conference speech
OL,10,Fsince taking office.
OL,12,FIn his letter to Andy Burnham, sent on
OL,13,FThursday and seen by BBC Wales, Rhun ap
OL,14,FIorwerth calls for more powers to be
OL,15,Ftransferred to Cardiff.
OL,17,FBurnham previously said he would "give
OL,18,Fa fair hearing" to anything put to him
OL,19,Fby the Welsh first minister.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
